","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":653,"digest":"sha256:f52dc30dac998bbe397b608102c195b0b73942eed3c08357ee957c3ff71f57ff","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-11-17T23:43:17Z","updated_at":"2026-11-17T23:43:17Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/enginsoysal/engacer-os/releases/download/m131-v0.13.1/m13stage1-starter-manifest.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enginsoysal/engacer-os/tarball/m131-v0.13.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enginsoysal/engacer-os/zipball/m131-v0.13.1","body":"# Engacer OS M13.1 / 0.13.1 — Shared native controls\n\nNative qualification passes for the exact candidate below. Public release and website acceptance remain pending; this file does not close M13.1.\n\nBuild: `e721ec183182aa23de268f7a6694a885`.\nISO SHA256: `40160132f13ec5850154f548a29b33e92f6495a2d3ef83c8fea93ca35c2863da`.\nVMware ZIP SHA256: `0e02bffbdd95fd6f91baa786c44482f797a18b44eaa94c5aefe91bd87281fa6f`.\n\n## Delivered native changes\n\nOne shared M13 light/dark/high-contrast palette, softer selection for secondary controls, existing smooth Inter typography and a real Settings → System → Interface preview. The bounded input, selection, disabled target exclusion and keyboard focus help use actual native controls. No extra app, dynamic per-window buffer, idle indexer or optional Calculator dependency was added.\n\n[Install and test](https://github.com/enginsoysal/engacer-os/blob/190caa3caf77afa45e2d424c34e8b52492359a5f/docs/handbook/install-m131.md), [how and why](https://github.com/enginsoysal/engacer-os/blob/190caa3caf77afa45e2d424c34e8b52492359a5f/docs/milestones/m13-1.md), [native acceptance](https://github.com/enginsoysal/engacer-os/blob/190caa3caf77afa45e2d424c34e8b52492359a5f/evidence/M13/1/acceptance-results.json), [resources](https://github.com/enginsoysal/engacer-os/blob/190caa3caf77afa45e2d424c34e8b52492359a5f/evidence/M13/1/resources.json).\n\n## Scope and limits\n\nThe native gate binds 600 compiled input digests, ordinary/compact/150%/actual-4K control journeys, independent startup and the exact enabled-device SATA/UEFI VMware package. Agent visual review is separate from human usability research. The full M13 installer/controller/device/application regression is M13.12, with installation-specific matrix work in M13.4. Historical M12 tests do not qualify untested new media.\n\nThe fixed shell remains 553,452 bytes and font masks 251,248 bytes. The measured control tasks retain zero additional managed pages and halt when idle; firmware, framebuffers, fixed state and configured guest RAM remain separate accounting categories. This does not claim zero OS memory or a gaming GPU driver.\n\nThe website's opt-in same-page search and reader-task article navigation require their own live browser publication proof. Their locally passing tests are not a production receipt. Broader physical/ARM hardware, Secure Boot enrollment, vendor GPU 3D, Steam and general DOS/Windows apps remain outside this stage. The installer retains its existing whole-disk replacement model; data-preserving resize and dual boot are not claimed.\n"}